OL,3,GNEWSASix members re-elected to Sark's  
OL,4,AChief Pleas                            
OL,6,FSix sitting members have been returned 
OL,7,Fto Sark's Chief Pleas after the Sark   
OL,8,Fgeneral election recorded its highest  
OL,9,Fvoter turnout in 20 years.             
OL,11,FMembers Helen Plummer, Patrick Dewe,   
OL,12,FNick Moloney, John Guille, Karl Rang   
OL,13,Fand Joseph Perree were among the       
OL,14,Fsuccessful candidates following the    
OL,15,F73.67% voter turnout.                  
OL,17,FThey were joined by Andrew Leaman,     
OL,18,FThomas Lalor, Helen Sturman and Elliott
OL,19,FOsborn.                                
