OL,6,FSitting member Carol Cragoe lost her   
OL,7,Fseat, while candidates TomaE> Slivnik, 
OL,8,FAlan McKendry, Charlotte Golding,      
OL,9,FDaniel Golding and Christian Bravery   
OL,10,Fwere also unsuccessful.                
